|i7 : grading Rdual                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = | -1 -1 -1 -1 5  |                                                      |
|     | -1 -1 -1 5  -1 |                                                      |
|     | -1 -1 5  -1 -1 |                                                      |
|     | -1 5  -1 -1 -1 |                                                      |
|     | 5  -1 -1 -1 -1 |                                                      |
|     | -1 -1 -1 -1 -1 |                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|              6       5                                                      |
|o7 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : dC1=coComplex(Rdual,fdC)                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = 2: v v v  v v v  v v v  v v v  v v v  v v v  v v v  v v v               |
|         0 1 2  0 1 4  0 3 4  1 2 3  1 2 5  1 4 5  2 3 4  3 4 5              |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : co-complex of dim 2 embedded in dim 5 (printing facets)                 |
