|                                                                           |
|o5 = 0: x  x  x  x  x                                                      |
|         4  3  2  1  0                                                     |
|                                                                           |
|o5 : co-complex of dim 0 embedded in dim 4 (printing facets)               |
|     equidimensional, simplicial, F-vector {0, 5, 10, 10, 5, 1}, Euler = 1 |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : complement cbC == bC                                                  |
|                                                                           |
|o6 = true                                                                  |
