|                                                                          |
|o15 = x                                                                   |
|       1                                                                  |
|                                                                          |
|o15 : face with 1 vertex                                                  |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i16 : deformationsFace(F,C1)                                              |
|                                                                          |
|                 2                                                        |
|       x   x    x                                                         |
|        1   1    1                                                        |
|o16 = {--, --, ----}                                                      |
|       x   x   x x                                                        |
|        4   3   3 4                                                       |
|                                                                          |
|o16 : List                                                                |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i17 : F=C1.fc_1_1                                                         |
|                                                                          |
|o17 = x x                                                                 |
|       0 3                                                                |
|                                                                          |
|o17 : face with 2 vertices                                                |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
