Description
===========

Checks whether F and G are equal.



+-------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=QQ[x_0..x_4];                 |
+-------------------------------------+
|i2 : face {x_0,x_1} == face {x_1,x_0}|
|                                     |
|o2 = true                            |
+-------------------------------------+
|i3 : addCokerGrading R;              |
|                                     |
|              5       4              |
|o3 : Matrix ZZ  <-- ZZ               |
