grading(FirstOrderDeformation) -- The small torus grading of a deformation.
***************************************************************************

  * Function: *note grading: grading,
  * Usage: 
        grading(f)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note first order deformation: FirstOrderDeformation,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, 

Description
===========

Returns the small torus grading of R = *note simplexRing: simplexRing, C, i.e.,
the grading added to R by *note addCokerGrading: addCokerGrading,.

+------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=QQ[x_0..x_4];                                  |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : addCokerGrading(R);                              |
|                                                      |
|              5       4                               |
|o2 : Matrix ZZ  <-- ZZ                                |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : I=ideal(x_0*x_1,x_1*x_2,x_2*x_3,x_3*x_4,x_4*x_0) |
|                                                      |
|o3 = ideal (x x , x x , x x , x x , x x )             |
