isHomogeneous(FirstOrderDeformation) -- Check whether a deformation is homogeneous.
***********************************************************************************

  * Function: *note isHomogeneous: (Macaulay2Doc)isHomogeneous,
  * Usage: 
        isHomogeneous(f)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note first order deformation: FirstOrderDeformation,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, 

Description
===========

Checks whether a deformation f is homogeneous with respect to the small torus
grading, i.e., the grading added to R = *note simplexRing: simplexRing, f by
*note addCokerGrading: addCokerGrading,.

+------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=QQ[x_0..x_4];                                  |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : addCokerGrading(R);                              |
|                                                      |
|              5       4                               |
|o2 : Matrix ZZ  <-- ZZ                                |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : I=ideal(x_0*x_1,x_1*x_2,x_2*x_3,x_3*x_4,x_4*x_0) |
|                                                      |
|o3 = ideal (x x , x x , x x , x x , x x )             |
|             0 1   1 2   2 3   3 4   0 4              |
|                                                      |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                       |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : mg=mingens I;                                    |
|                                                      |
|             1      5                                 |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R                                  |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : f=firstOrderDeformation(mg, vector {-1,-1,0,2,0})|
|                                                      |
|       2                                              |
|      x                                               |
|       3                                              |
|o5 = ----                                             |
|     x x                                              |
|      0 1                                             |
|                                                      |
|o5 : first order deformation space of dimension 1     |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : isHomogeneous f                                  |
|                                                      |
|o6 = true                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note degree(FirstOrderDeformation): degree_lpFirstOrderDeformation_rp, --
    The small torus degree of a deformation.
  * *note grading: grading, -- The grading of a first order deformation or
    complex or polynomial ring.
